{
  // ==========================================================================
  // ETK 854 ActiveHybrid - default keyboard bindings (vehicle inputmap)
  // ==========================================================================
  // Scheme: Alt + mnemonic, nothing on F-keys. Alt+M = legacy preset cycle;
  //   Alt+H/J/Comma/Period/Backspace/V = centre display controller (panel,
  //   press, rotate left/right, back, view); Alt+C = cluster view.
  // Free in the 0.39.4 keyboard maps except alt w (World Editor only, never
  //   active while driving); alt r is distinct from reset_physics on r.
  // Avoided (driving map): f5, f7, f8, alt a, alt up / down,
  //   alt l (couplersUnlock would drop a hitched trailer).
  // ==========================================================================
